    "directions": [
      "In a Kadai heat ghee and add green chillies, curry leaves, ginger, coriander leaves and saute for half a minute.",
      "Now bring it to one side and on the other side heat ghee then add cumin seeds, mustard seeds, let them crackle and then pour in the water, mix everything together.",
      "Then add salt, turmeric powder, curd, roasted bombay rava and mix everything properly and continue cooking until it soft dough or its comes together.",
      "Remove on a greased tray and even it out then keep in the fridge to set properly.",
      "Once set properly remove it out from the tray and cut in fingers then deep fry in medium hot oil until golden brown and crispy. Serve hot with fresh salad and chilli garlic mayonnaise.",
      "In a bowl add tomatoes, onion, purple cabbage, salt, green chillies, curry leaves, lemon juice, flavourless oil and mix everything properly and keep aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl add chopped garlic, coriander leaves, red chilli flakes, mayonnaise and mix everything properly and keep aside for further use."
    ],
